get.description:
Retrieves a list of inputs required to refresh a Clone of a given database type.
This will return the complete metadata for each input property such as display name, description, and more.
Only the 'name' and 'value' should be given to the 'actionArguments' part of the input JSON for registering a Clone. Example:
```
{
  ...
  ...
  'actionArguments': [
    {
      'name': 'db_prop_1',
      'value': 'val1'
    },
    {
      'name': 'db_prop_2',
      'value': 'val2'
    },
    ...
    ...
  ]
}
```

Get a list of inputs required to provision a Database of the given type.
This will return the complete metadata for each input property such as display name, description, and more.
Only the 'name' and 'value' should be given to the 'provisionInfo' part of the input JSON for provisioning a Database. Example:
```
{
  ...
  ...
  'provisionInfo': [
    {
      'name': 'db_prop_1',
      'value': 'val1'
    },
    {
      'name': 'db_prop_2',
      'value': 'val2'
    },
    ...
    ...
  ]
}
```

Get a list of inputs required to register a Database of the given type.
This returns the complete metadata for each input property such as display name, description, and more.
Only the 'name' and 'value' should be given to the 'applicationInfo' part of the input JSON for registering a Database. Example:
```
{
  ...
  ...
  'applicationInfo': [
    {
      'name': 'vm_ip',
      'value': '10.10.10.10'
    },
    {
      'name': 'db_prop_1',
      'value': 'val1'
    },
    ...
    ...
  ]
}
```

post.description:
Perform the Log Catchup Operation of the source Database.
Use the below JSON:
```
{
  'actionHeader': [
    {
      'name': 'switch_log',
      'value': 'true'
    }
  ]
}
```

